    "language": "si-ta-en",
    "md5": "8d9fbe01c40a329389372c918c4ac22c",
    "chunk_size_bytes": 1613,
    "chunk_text": "Sri Lanka cannot afford to treat this as a transient technical glitch. It must recognize that its digital government infrastructure is now a strategic national asset requiring the same vigilance, investment and oversight as its physical borders or defence installations do. Parliament, therefore, has an urgent duty to demand full accountability, ensure a comprehensive forensic audit of the Lanka Government Cloud and to establish a National Cyber Security Command Authority with powers to secure, monitor and defend all critical digital assets of the State.\n\nSir, I can understand the situation because this is something new that has happened. But, I thought it was necessary - the Hon. Deputy Minister is technologically\n\nSir, Accordingly, I wish to ask the Hon. Minister of Technology the following questions:\n\n1. Can the Hon. Minister inform this House what specific technical or administrative failure led to the collapse of the Lanka Government Cloud - LGC - on 14th October 2025 and whether any preliminary investigation or forensic audit has identified accountability within the ICTA or its service providers?\n\n2. Will the Hon. Minister confirm whether the incident was purely an internal systems failure, as stated by the Sri Lanka Computer Emergency Readiness Team - SLCERT, or whether there is any evidence of external cyber intrusion or data compromise?\n\n3. How many similar system breakdowns, service disruptions or cyber incidents have occurred in the key government digital platforms over the past 12 months and what lessons have been learnt or corrective measures have been instituted thereafter?"
  },
  {
    "doc_type": "lk_hansard_2020s",
    "doc_id": "2025-10-23-2025-10-23",
    "num": "2025-10-23",
    "date_str": "2025-10-23",
    "description": "Hansard of 2025-10-23",
    "url_metadata": "https://www.parliament.lk/en/business-of-parliament/hansards",
    "lang": "si-ta-en",
    "url_pdf": "https://www.parliament.lk/uploads/businessdocs/english/22641_english_2025-10-23.pdf",
