    "chunk_text": "7. What steps are being taken to restore public and international confidence in the security of Sri Lanka\u2019s e-Government systems, particularly given the increasing frequency of cyber attacks on banks, public institutions and digital payment networks in the last six to ten months?\n\n8. Will the Government consider the establishment of a legally empowered National Cyber Security Command Authority to coordinate, monitor and defend all national digital assets under a unified structure?\n\n9. As Sri Lanka accelerates its transition towards full digital governance - I fully appreciate that and the quicker we do that, far more beneficial it would be to the country and there should be no retardation of that, taking necessary precautions to ensure that while doing so it would not affect, harm or compromise the people of this country - what legislative policy and institutional safeguards are being introduced to prevent future cyberattacks or system collapses of this magnitude? Specifically, when will the Government bring before Parliament a comprehensive Digital Transformation Act and a Cyber Security Protection Law to ensure national preparedness and resilience?\n\n10. Finally, what assurance can the Hon. Minister give to the people of Sri Lanka that such a collapse of the nation\u2019s digital backbone would never recur and that the Government possesses the readiness, expertise and resilience to withstand future cyber threats of this magnitude?\n\nSir, may I just add one more thing. This was something that we have been trying to achieve from 2015 when I was Minister of Finance, but resistance from government servants retarded the success story. The Eastern European countries have managed to come up with their success story owing to the fact that they digitized their economy. I know the Deputy Minister is a very competent person, and my request to you is, while becoming a digitalized economy, ensure that we fast-track it with proven ability so that we would not suffer in the future."
  },
  {
    "doc_type": "lk_hansard_2020s",
    "doc_id": "2025-10-23-2025-10-23",
    "num": "2025-10-23",
