    "description": "Hansard of 2025-10-23",
    "url_metadata": "https://www.parliament.lk/en/business-of-parliament/hansards",
    "lang": "si-ta-en",
    "url_pdf": "https://www.parliament.lk/uploads/businessdocs/english/22641_english_2025-10-23.pdf",
    "chunk_id": "2025-10-23-2025-10-23-0057",
    "chunk_index": 57,
    "language": "si-ta-en",
    "md5": "3c38ccb9dbf3cff85ae27490257eb344",
    "chunk_size_bytes": 1989,
    "chunk_text": "Also, following that incident, ICTA initiated enhanced monitoring of the previously affected components. We took those lessons learnt as a mechanism to go for the procurement of a new LGC 2.5 so that all the shortcomings available in the current LGC could be addressed.\n\n\u0d9c\u0dd4 \u0d9a\u0dae\u0dcf\u0db1\u0dcf\u0dba\u0d9a\u0dd4\u0dbb\u0dd9\u0dcf (\u0bc8\u0bc6\u0bbe\u0ba3\u0bcd\u0baa\u0bc1\u0bc8\u0bbf\u0b95\u0bc1 \u0b9a\u0baa\u0bc6\u0bbe\u0ba8\u0bc6\u0bbe\u0baf\u0b95\u0bb0\u0bcd \u0b85\u0bb5\u0bb0\u0bcd\u0b95\u0bb3\u0bcd) (The Hon. Speaker) Hon. Member, you can get a clarification after the Hon. Deputy Minister answers.\n\n\u0d9c\u0dd4 \u0dbb\u0dd3 \u0d9a\u0dd4\u0dab\u0dcf\u0db1\u0dcf\u0dba\u0d9a \u0dd9\u0dc4\u0dc3\u0dad\u0dcf (\u0bc8\u0bc6\u0bbe\u0ba3\u0bcd\u0baa\u0bc1\u0bc8\u0bbf\u0b95\u0bc1 \u0bb5\u0bbf \u0b95\u0bb0\u0bc1\u0bc8\u0bc6\u0bbe\u0ba8\u0bc6\u0bbe\u0baf\u0b95\u0bcd\u0b95) (The Hon. Ravi Karunanayake) He can give an answer later. He has knowledge of technology. My knowledge of technology is not as sound as his. So, when your ASYCUDA system interconnects 21 Government institutions, if one bank or the Department of Registrar of Companies is not connected, then the entire network breaks down.\n\nSo, the financial implication would not be able to be computed in this manner. When you say \u201cnot possible\u201d, it is not correct because if one institution goes back to manual processing, there would not be any interconnection.\n\n\u0d9c\u0dd4 \u0d9a\u0dae\u0dcf\u0db1\u0dcf\u0dba\u0d9a\u0dd4\u0dbb\u0dd9\u0dcf (\u0bc8\u0bc6\u0bbe\u0ba3\u0bcd\u0baa\u0bc1\u0bc8\u0bbf\u0b95\u0bc1 \u0b9a\u0baa\u0bc6\u0bbe\u0ba8\u0bc6\u0bbe\u0baf\u0b95\u0bb0\u0bcd \u0b85\u0bb5\u0bb0\u0bcd\u0b95\u0bb3\u0bcd) (The Hon. Speaker) Hon. Deputy Minister, you may proceed.\n\n\u0d9c\u0dd4 \u0d91\u0dbb\u0d82\u0d9c \u0dd3\u0dbb\u0dbb\u0dca \u0db1 \u0dd9\u0dc4\u0dc3\u0dad\u0dcf (\u0bc8\u0bc6\u0bbe\u0ba3\u0bcd\u0baa\u0bc1\u0bc8\u0bbf\u0b95\u0bc1 \u0b8e \u0b99\u0bcd\u0b95 \u0bb5\u0bc0 \u0ba4\u0bcd\u0ba9) (The Hon. Eranga Weeraratne) Hon. Member, systems like ASYCUDA are run by separate data centres. Therefore, those systems were not affected. I understand that certain government services\n\nhad been affected. However, since they reverted to manual processing, no service delivery had been affected during the collapse which prolonged for one week. Therefore, we have not received any information about any financial or economic impact to any of these institutions up to this moment."
  },
