    "chunk_index": 61,
    "language": "si-ta-en",
    "md5": "d76e434157fc7dc84474bdb04ed7c1c4",
    "chunk_size_bytes": 1707,
    "chunk_text": "The disk utilization was brought down to 88 per cent or below and also, as and when the workloads are migrated to the new LGC, those will be removed from the current Legacy to free more space. And the National Cybersecurity Operations Centre - NCSOC - will monitor the LGC 2.5, 24/7.\n\nThe SLT Data Centre - NOC, Network Operations Centre - will monitor the new system 24/7 to ensure that it maintains all the KPIs round the clock, ensuring service integrity and performance.\n\nSir, that concludes my Answer.\n\n2531 2532\n\n\u0db4\u0ddc\u0dbb\u0dca\u0dd2\u0db1\u0db8\u0dca \u0dd4\u0dc5\u0dc0\n\n\u0d9c\u0dd4 \u0d9a\u0dae\u0dcf\u0db1\u0dcf\u0dba\u0d9a\u0dd4\u0dbb\u0dd9\u0dcf (\u0bc8\u0bc6\u0bbe\u0ba3\u0bcd\u0baa\u0bc1\u0bc8\u0bbf\u0b95\u0bc1 \u0b9a\u0baa\u0bc6\u0bbe\u0ba8\u0bc6\u0bbe\u0baf\u0b95\u0bb0\u0bcd \u0b85\u0bb5\u0bb0\u0bcd\u0b95\u0bb3\u0bcd) (The Hon. Speaker) Hon. Ravi Karunanayake, now you can get a quick clarification from the Hon. Deputy Minister.\n\n\u0d9c\u0dd4 \u0dbb\u0dd3 \u0d9a\u0dd4\u0dab\u0dcf\u0db1\u0dcf\u0dba\u0d9a \u0dd9\u0dc4\u0dc3\u0dad\u0dcf (\u0bc8\u0bc6\u0bbe\u0ba3\u0bcd\u0baa\u0bc1\u0bc8\u0bbf\u0b95\u0bc1 \u0bb5\u0bbf \u0b95\u0bb0\u0bc1\u0bc8\u0bc6\u0bbe\u0ba8\u0bc6\u0bbe\u0baf\u0b95\u0bcd\u0b95) (The Hon. Ravi Karunanayake) Sir, I appreciate the professional Answer that has been given. Hon. Deputy Minister, your knowledge of technology is far superior to mine. So, my question is more from a practical point of view. Even Bill Gate's personal accounts were hacked by a 21-year old Asian. Therefore, I guess we have to take ultra-precautionary action. White-collar crimes are becoming more realistic than could be avoided. As a result, you do not know when digital frauds would be committed. You know that the Central Bank and other banks of Bangladesh were hacked and that the Philippines had the same issue four years ago. So, considering those particular issues, there is a necessity to ensure that we are ultra-safe when we are going ahead with digitization."
  },
