    "chunk_text": "\u0d9c\u0dd4 \u0dbb\u0dd3 \u0d9a\u0dd4\u0dab\u0dcf\u0db1\u0dcf\u0dba\u0d9a \u0dd9\u0dc4\u0dc3\u0dad\u0dcf (\u0bc8\u0bc6\u0bbe\u0ba3\u0bcd\u0baa\u0bc1\u0bc8\u0bbf\u0b95\u0bc1 \u0bb5\u0bbf \u0b95\u0bb0\u0bc1\u0bc8\u0bc6\u0bbe\u0ba8\u0bc6\u0bbe\u0baf\u0b95\u0bcd\u0b95) (The Hon. Ravi Karunanayake) Sir, I appreciate the professional Answer that has been given. Hon. Deputy Minister, your knowledge of technology is far superior to mine. So, my question is more from a practical point of view. Even Bill Gate's personal accounts were hacked by a 21-year old Asian. Therefore, I guess we have to take ultra-precautionary action. White-collar crimes are becoming more realistic than could be avoided. As a result, you do not know when digital frauds would be committed. You know that the Central Bank and other banks of Bangladesh were hacked and that the Philippines had the same issue four years ago. So, considering those particular issues, there is a necessity to ensure that we are ultra-safe when we are going ahead with digitization.\n\nSir, the next matter I need to check out is, the cyber authority -\n\n\u0d9c\u0dd4 \u0d9a\u0dae\u0dcf\u0db1\u0dcf\u0dba\u0d9a\u0dd4\u0dbb\u0dd9\u0dcf (\u0bc8\u0bc6\u0bbe\u0ba3\u0bcd\u0baa\u0bc1\u0bc8\u0bbf\u0b95\u0bc1 \u0b9a\u0baa\u0bc6\u0bbe\u0ba8\u0bc6\u0bbe\u0baf\u0b95\u0bb0\u0bcd \u0b85\u0bb5\u0bb0\u0bcd\u0b95\u0bb3\u0bcd) (The Hon. Speaker) Hon. Member, make your clarification short. \u0d9c\u0dd4 \u0dbb\u0dd3 \u0d9a\u0dd4\u0dab\u0dcf\u0db1\u0dcf\u0dba\u0d9a \u0dd9\u0dc4\u0dc3\u0dad\u0dcf (\u0bc8\u0bc6\u0bbe\u0ba3\u0bcd\u0baa\u0bc1\u0bc8\u0bbf\u0b95\u0bc1 \u0bb5\u0bbf \u0b95\u0bb0\u0bc1\u0bc8\u0bc6\u0bbe\u0ba8\u0bc6\u0bbe\u0baf\u0b95\u0bcd\u0b95) (The Hon. Ravi Karunanayake) That is also something that needs to be done because an ADB professional in Sri Lanka says, \"Cybercrime costs Sri Lanka up to US Dollars 1 billion a year.\" US Dollars 1 billion a year! When we are talking of a total GDP of US Dollars 78 billion, the Government's revenue from exports is only US Dollars 20 billion, which is 5 per cent of it. So, it is not something that you can ignore. Also, you have gone on record saying that you want to have this digital governance in order to ensure that we capture the market tier and that international players such as MIT and others are trying to restore confidence here.\n\n\u0d9c\u0dd4 \u0d9a\u0dae\u0dcf\u0db1\u0dcf\u0dba\u0d9a\u0dd4\u0dbb\u0dd9\u0dcf (\u0bc8\u0bc6\u0bbe\u0ba3\u0bcd\u0baa\u0bc1\u0bc8\u0bbf\u0b95\u0bc1 \u0b9a\u0baa\u0bc6\u0bbe\u0ba8\u0bc6\u0bbe\u0baf\u0b95\u0bb0\u0bcd \u0b85\u0bb5\u0bb0\u0bcd\u0b95\u0bb3\u0bcd) (The Hon. Speaker) Hon. Member, would you please make your clarification according to the Answer given? Now, you have already taken two minutes for your clarification."
  },
